      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CareGuide – Knowledge Base Ingestion\nRun manually. Downloads the knowledge file (knowledge/careguide_knowledge_v3.txt, uploaded to Google Drive), splits it on the ===== lines so each Q&A block is one chunk, embeds it with Ollama (nomic-embed-text) and stores it in the Chroma collection careguide_v5.\n\n**Setup:** create Google Drive, Ollama and ChromaDB credentials, then select your Drive file in 'Download file'.\n\nChroma insert appends data: use a new collection name if you re-run on the same file.",
